            <item>
                <title>瞎扯 · 如何正确地吐槽</title>
                <link>http://daily.zhihu.com/story/9792314</link>
                <description>瞎扯 · 诸葛亮在四川有着怎样的地位？ 知乎日报 查看知乎原文 Q： 诸葛亮在四川有着怎样的地位？ @境外势力 ：之前去武侯祠玩 吓哭了 Q：有哪些非常冷门的冷知识？ @何锐锐 ： 1 、基围虾：基地围场的养殖虾。2 、砂糖橘：砂糖村产的橘子，故名，与甜度无关。3 、口蘑：全称「张家口蘑菇」，内蒙古的蘑菇拉到张家口售卖而得名。4 、蛇果，美国红苹果，英文名叫 red delicious apple…</description>
                <content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="main-img" style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><img src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e38d29d44440ef6f0bb1d6fab68ae2bd.jpg?source=8673f162" style="max-width:100%; border-radius: 8px;"></div><div class="main-wrap content-wrap">
<div class="headline">

<div class="img-place-holder"></div>



</div>

<div class="content-inner">




<div class="question">
<h2 class="question-title">瞎扯 · 诸葛亮在四川有着怎样的地位？</h2>

<div class="answer">

<div class="meta">
<img class="avatar" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-fc734cfcc0b308e24640f9b5a2d2316d_l.jpg?source=8673f162">
<span class="author">知乎日报</span>
<a href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/None/answer/None" class="originUrl" hidden>查看知乎原文</a>
</div>

<div class="content">
<p>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/314045605/answer/1969771148062495742"> 诸葛亮在四川有着怎样的地位？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/5d6942aa8a97f0ed4444f8d11518548d" target="_blank">@境外势力</a></div>
 ：之前去<a class="RichContent-EntityWord css-b7erz1" href="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=281546178&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E6%AD%A6%E4%BE%AF%E7%A5%A0&amp;zhida_source=entity" target="_blank">武侯祠</a>玩 吓哭了</blockquote>
<figure>
<div class="RichText-ConditionalImagePortal"><img class="content-image" src="https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-55d41c65ff88ef5b96ffab208c862cf5_1440w.jpg" alt=""></div>
<figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<figure>
<div class="RichText-ConditionalImagePortal"><img class="content-image" src="https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-d942d746ee5d85165f18c21870d44989_1440w.jpg" alt=""></div>
<figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<figure>
<div class="RichText-ConditionalImagePortal"><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2d86542006295a3658c7fea6829bcc58_1440w.jpg" alt=""></div>
<figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<p>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/286733591/answer/1960801439262671723">有哪些非常冷门的冷知识？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/827b60ed5e84ee05dc804ac7539025c6" target="_blank">@何锐锐</a></div>
 ： 1 、基围虾：基地围场的养殖虾。<br>2 、砂糖橘：砂糖村产的橘子，故名，与甜度无关。<br>3 、口蘑：全称「<a class="RichContent-EntityWord css-b7erz1" href="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=281546178&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E5%BC%A0%E5%AE%B6%E5%8F%A3&amp;zhida_source=entity" target="_blank">张家口</a>蘑菇」，内蒙古的蘑菇拉到张家口售卖而得名。<br>4 、蛇果，美国红苹果，英文名叫 red delicious apple ，香港音译过来叫红地厘蛇苹果，简称蛇果。<br>5 、<a class="RichContent-EntityWord css-b7erz1" href="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=281546178&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E5%B7%B4%E8%A5%BF%E6%9D%BE%E5%AD%90&amp;zhida_source=entity" target="_blank">巴西松子</a>：来自巴基斯坦，巴西其实是「巴基斯坦西部」的缩写。<br>6 、九尺鹅肠：起源于四川省成都市<a class="RichContent-EntityWord css-b7erz1" href="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=281546178&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E5%BD%AD%E5%B7%9E%E5%B8%82&amp;zhida_source=entity" target="_blank">彭州市</a>九尺镇，故名。<br>7 、车厘子：就是欧洲甜樱桃，名字来源于樱桃「 cherries 」的音译。</blockquote>
<p>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/33690764/answer/2044548235340076727">你见过的真正的 Photoshop 高手是什么样的？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/251360a384ef893a9d8174f52617175f" target="_blank">@太谷很能打</a></div>
 ：在影楼，老板叫修图的小姑娘做个表格，小姑娘不会 Excel ，硬是用 <a class="RichContent-EntityWord css-b7erz1" href="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=281546178&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=PS&amp;zhida_source=entity" target="_blank">PS</a> 画了一个表格。</blockquote>
<p>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/2045831566538924509/answer/2047060935056142779">如果一门课程的作业可以用 AI 完成，这门课该不该取消？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/394ebcd1e2f41b3b426c680e474c8001" target="_blank">@呆滞饮茶狐</a></div>
 ：我目前遇到的作业都可以被 <a class="RichContent-EntityWord css-b7erz1" href="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=281546178&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=ai&amp;zhida_source=entity" target="_blank">ai</a> 做出来，但你应该不太想要 ai 医生，至少就现在而言……</blockquote>
<p>Q：<a class="internal" href="https://www.zhihu.com/question/268660866/answer/2034269871534552056">你见过的最神奇的朋友圈是什么？</a></p>
<blockquote>
<div class="css-1gomreu"><a class="UserLink-link" href="https://www.zhihu.com/people/1ce4b9e4a9ac0130707b750f7c0379d8" target="_blank">@我要用屁股创死你</a></div>
 ：必须晒一个，这个是我表弟的，哈哈哈哈，太牛了，哈哈哈</blockquote>
<figure>
<div class="RichText-ConditionalImagePortal"><img class="content-image" src="https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-3b5adf38f97f3e7a7f4ab5e6be17fb25_1440w.jpg" alt=""></div>
<figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<figure>
<div class="RichText-ConditionalImagePortal"><img class="content-image" src="https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-cd668b9fe42d7657f9be102d3ec830b8_1440w.jpg" alt=""></div>
<figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<hr>
<p>✨恭喜你发现了（即将成为）知乎最好笑的地方，加入「扯点好笑的」圈子，每天看点段子梗图神回复，一起一本正经地胡说八道吧！</p>
<div class="RichText-LinkCardContainer"><a class="LinkCard new css-1a2w32z" href="https://www.zhihu.com/ring/host/1979586347799950567?tab=new&amp;tab_id=0" target="_blank"><span class="LinkCard-image"><img class="content-image" src="https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-cc40831259b8877ee1f920e7343d6cae_l.jpg?source=1a5df958" alt=""></span><span class="LinkCard-contents"><span class="LinkCard-title two-line">扯点好笑的</span></span></a></div>
</div>
</div>


</div>


</div>
</div><script type=“text/javascript”>window.daily=true</script>]]></content:encoded>
